help
-- SunWeb commands:
pa                     - probe all SunWeb Devices
ra                     - release all SunWeb Devices
da                     - dump all SunWeb Devices found
bm_add <box> <id>      - add SunWeb Device to busmap
bm_dump                - dump busmap
bm_erase               - erase busmap FLASH
bm_present             - check busmap present
-- SimSun commands:
ss_dred <id> <num>     - set maximum light intensity Deep Red LEDs
ss_rblu <id> <num>     - set maximum light intensity Royal Blu LEDs
ss_clock               - set SimSun time
ss_dawn <hh> <mm> <ss> - set SimSun dawn
ss_dusk <hh> <mm> <ss> - set SimSun dusk
ss_start <id>          - start SimSun light program
ss_stop <id>           - start SimSun light program
ss_ntcerr <id> <num>   - write NTC calibration parameter [10*oC]
-- HotBed commands:
hb_set [id] <temp>     - set HotBed temperature
hb_get <id>            - get HotBed temperature
hb_start               - start HotBed PID temperature control  (multicast)
hb_stop                - stop HotBed PID temperature control   (multicast)
hb_led [id] <pwm>      - set HotBed bottom LEDs intensity
hb_fan [id] <pwm>      - set HotBed fan speed
hb_show <on|off>       - start/stop HotBed bottom LEDs show    (multicast)
hb_pt100 [id]          - get HotBed Pt100 temperatures
hb_pterr [id]          - get HotBed Pt100 offset errors
-- misc. commands:
q                      - quit logging & stuff
version                - dump version information
help                   - dump this help
